      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARA'S ROCKY (6) jumps from box 6 for the first time after placing latest at this track (25.47) in a Grade 5. Has never missed the frame here from eight starts. Top chance in this line up. ZIPPING HOLLY (2) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 4.5 lengths at this track in a handy 25.17 beating Touch Of Glass. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from four attempts. One of main contenders. MYTHIC (1) has a strong record here with three wins and a minor from five starts. Comes off a (19.83) win last time, scoring by 1.75 lengths in a Grade 5 over 340m at this track. Looks suited here and can measure up. CASUAL ESCAPE (5) is last start winner who looks one of the chances.",
